window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They call me the wild one. The Ryker brother who'd rather have more notches on his bedpost than rodeo championships.</p> <p>I'm good with horses, even better with women. I've been warned that sowing my oats might have consequences, but I'm always careful. And there's nothing wrong with having a little fun.</p> <p>But the truth is I want more than fun. I want it all. With the right girl.</p> <p>So when the most beautiful woman I've ever seen shows up at my ranch, it should all fall into place. Except she's got a big surprise for me. She's pregnant, and the kid is mine, but she wants nothing to do with me.</p>"; 
